{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/extras/355071746d947c3424fc1717ad2de01b.avif?t=1753545718\" width=620 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Birth Of X</strong> is a slow-burning psychological horror where grief and madness become one. Solve symbolic puzzles tied to fragments of the past\u2014birth certificates, divorce papers, childhood belongings. Each object reveals a piece of a personal tragedy twisted into nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/extras/acdf562ea8e3fc3865f012a6282d0cb0.poster.avif?t=1753545718\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/extras/acdf562ea8e3fc3865f012a6282d0cb0.webm?t=1753545718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/extras/acdf562ea8e3fc3865f012a6282d0cb0.mp4?t=1753545718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you're not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It came from the box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It crawls through the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s always behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it won\u2019t leave until you make a choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/extras/47d261a664ca949371cece9659651ac0.poster.avif?t=1753545718\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/extras/47d261a664ca949371cece9659651ac0.webm?t=1753545718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/extras/47d261a664ca949371cece9659651ac0.mp4?t=1753545718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/extras/519af29b9f541a87dff255cb13e8520f.avif?t=1753545718\" width=620 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive, suffocating atmosphere. You\u2019re not only scared by what jumps out\u2014but by what lingers in the silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use documents and personal belongings to solve narrative-driven puzzles rooted in grief, memory, and identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creature that\u2019s always near\u2014just like your guilt. You feel it, even when you try to pretend the pain isn\u2019t there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/extras/da4077d55d8fea97aea41a06f624bfe8.poster.avif?t=1753545718\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/extras/da4077d55d8fea97aea41a06f624bfe8.webm?t=1753545718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/extras/da4077d55d8fea97aea41a06f624bfe8.mp4?t=1753545718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for items that help you progress through the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet engaging puzzles that draw you deeper into the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumpscares that will make your heart skip a beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant psychological tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features autosave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outstanding sound design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average playtime: 60 minutes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/extras/ebcee4db8df407b84e7f52f2d557137f.avif?t=1753545718\" width=620 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features puzzles, jumpscares, and stories related to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles may be quite challenging for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're not a fan of this genre, we do not recommend playing this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note! The game features machine translation into the following languages:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- French</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- German</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Spanish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Portuguese (Brazilian)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Chinese (Simplified)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Korean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Polish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Japanese</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899630?t=1753545718","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/286289cd8e13c19e06a6fa4c40d6a2f1a45d72f4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753545718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/2ebcec9f23ca400bf81576ab16e1bd12160237ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753545718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/2ebcec9f23ca400bf81576ab16e1bd12160237ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753545718","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full con