aging puzzles that draw you deeper into the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumpscares that will make your heart skip a beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant psychological tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features autosave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outstanding sound design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average playtime: 60 minutes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/extras/ebcee4db8df407b84e7f52f2d557137f.avif?t=1753545718\" width=620 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features puzzles, jumpscares, and stories related to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles may be quite challenging for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're not a fan of this genre, we do not recommend playing this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note! The game features machine translation into the following languages:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- French</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- German</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Spanish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Portuguese (Brazilian)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Chinese (Simplified)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Korean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Polish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Japanese</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Beshbarmak games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899630/7aedf731cbc3a51946a61685ee69316cfa42a42c/header.jpg?t=1753545718","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">